    {
      "id": "claim_c8012710c17c48d28c12196f837f0087",
      "statement": "Because the HTTP intake is public, envelopes from unknown senders are honored only for bootstrap types (hello, challenge, friend_request, and the open-services service_search/service_book/service_cancel/service_quote): those must embed the sender's public key in the payload so the router can verify fingerprint == SHA-256(key) and a valid signature with that key before any state changes.",
