    {
      "id": "claim_45cd593eac6a43e18172d9b630d66dd4",
      "statement": "Hermes skill introspection powers the skills array of both manifest formats: scan_installed_skills scans ~/.hermes/skills and ~/.hermes/profiles/default/skills (SKILLS_CANDIDATES, overridable per call), reads each skill directory's SKILL.md frontmatter with a dependency-free regex extracting only the name and description keys, degrades gracefully on broken frontmatter (directory name plus empty description), and deduplicates skills by name.",
