    {
      "id": "claim_5f22b9b331534033b371272464b9622b",
      "statement": "The served well-known document is the key-free, unsigned haap-public-manifest-v1 card (agent block {fingerprint, name, speciality, endpoint} plus message_types/skills/tools arrays), whose agent.endpoint is a base URL from which peers derive the messaging endpoint by appending /haap/messages. Discovery is re-verified against the agent itself: client.refresh_endpoint fetches the friend's well-known card and raises DiscoveryError unless its fingerprint matches the recorded friend ('possible endpoint substitution'), implementing the rule that the directory is a phone book, not a notary.",
