        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c6b562da0ef447379a2445ee9eb739bf",
      "statement": "A native Hermes inbound bridge — an incoming webhook feeding the HAAP router plus owner-chat notifications — is documented design, not shipped code: ARQUITECTURA's roadmap lists 'Puente a Hermes: webhook entrante -> router HAAP; notificaciones al dueno' as pending, the README names the native Hermes webhook bridge (owner chat notifications) as a roadmap item, and HttpTransport's docstring refers to 'the Hermes webhook bridge, which signs and forwards to the HAAP router' as the intended future inbound form.",
