    {
      "id": "claim_ad07e798a86e4f5e964fbc360471c2e1",
      "statement": "Two registry artifacts exist and must not be confused: the in-repo haap/registry.py is only a minimal in-memory reference directory (proof-of-endpoint registration, 24-hour entry TTL with lazy pruning, 10,000-agent anti-flooding cap), while the production public directory is the separate acoalex/haap-directory service, live at https://acoalex.com/haap-directory, whose entries expire after 7 days without renewal. The client-side HeartbeatLoop daemon thread renews an entry every 6 hours by default.",
